  "caveats": [
    "OpenCode core commit 95daf90670b7 and online V2 documentation disagree on summary request structure and keep budget; report separates them.",
    "OpenCode length acceptance is static analysis of the pinned core and OpenAI Chat path, not an executed reproduction.",
    "Hermes salvage_grown_transcript is documented as an available conditional helper; no claim that every compression invokes it.",
    "Pi maxTokens at the compaction call is a base SDK allowance; traditional Anthropic thinking can enlarge it and available context can reduce it.",
    "Claude Code compaction core and encrypted server compaction internals are not public source.",
    "Token estimates, provider tokens, character caps, generation caps, and summary publication caps are distinct."
  ]
